  "solution": "Xét tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có \n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mn>59</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>82</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>39</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tÁp dụng định lí hàm sin trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><m